name rulerbox
category Package
revision 50984
shortdesc Draw rulers around a box
longdesc This is a LaTeX package for drawing rulers around a box. This
longdesc might be useful when showing the absolute size of something in
longdesc electronic documents, or designating the relative scale in
longdesc printed materials.
